@model Product
<section class="shell inner-page admin-form-page"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><a asp-controller="Admin" asp-action="Index">Product manager</a><span>/</span><span>Delete dish</span></nav><div class="delete-card"><span class="delete-symbol" aria-hidden="true">!</span><span class="eyebrow">PLEASE CONFIRM</span><h1>Remove this <em>dish?</em></h1><div class="delete-product"><img src="@Model.ImageUrl" alt="" /><div><strong>@Model.Name</strong><span>₹@Model.Price.ToString("0")</span></div></div><p>This removes the dish from the menu. Existing orders keep a record of what was ordered.</p><div class="delete-actions"><a asp-controller="Admin" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline">Keep this dish</a><form asp-controller="Admin" asp-action="DeleteConfirmed" asp-route-id="@Model.Id" method="post"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger">Yes, delete dish</button></form></div></div></section>
